      "data": {
        "content": {
          "kind": "markdown",
          "value": "## hideLabel\n\nThe port's name is never shown as a sign. Set on the root and out-bottom ports.\n\n| | |\n|---|---|\n| Scope | port |\n| Written at | `port.metadata.hideLabel` |\n| Type | boolean |\n| Default | false |\n| Valid | true |\n| Applies | edit |\n| Properties panel | no |\n| Written down | no |\n| Status | built |"
