    },
    {
      "id": "authoring-switches-switch-semantic-zoom-resolution",
      "type": "content",
      "label": "semanticZoom.resolution",
      "position": {
        "x": 640,
        "y": 2480
      },
      "width": 600,
      "height": 620,
      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": true,
      "data": {
        "content": {
          "kind": "markdown",
          "value": "## semanticZoom.resolution\n\nWhere along the zoom a view takes over: 1 is the conventional detail, lower is smaller, and 3 opens the whole graph. Fractional values allow any number of views.\n\n| | |\n|---|---|\n| Scope | face |\n| Written at | `node.data.semanticZoom.resolution` |\n| Type | number |\n| Default | 1 |\n| Valid | 0 to 2.99 |\n| Applies | browse |\n| Properties panel | yes (\"Resolution\") |\n| Written down | the panel's helper text only |\n| Status | built |"
        },
        "switch": {
          "name": "semanticZoom.resolution",
          "scope": "face",
          "writtenAt": "node.data.semanticZoom.resolution",
          "type": "number",
          "default": "1",
          "valid": "0 to 2.99",
          "effect": "Where along the zoom a view takes over: 1 is the conventional detail, lower is smaller, and 3 opens the whole graph. Fractional values allow any number of views.",
          "appliesIn": "browse",
          "panel": "yes (\"Resolution\")",
          "writtenDown": "the panel's helper text only",
          "status": "built"
        },
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "authoring-switches"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "authoring-switches-switch-semantic-level",
      "type": "content",
      "label": "semanticLevel",
      "position": {
        "x": 1280,
        "y": 2480
      },
      "width": 600,
      "height": 620,
      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": true,
      "data": {
        "content": {
          "kind": "markdown",
          "value": "## semanticLevel\n\nNames the representation a face is. The algorithm that picks one for a size reads these; it is a policy, below.\n\n| | |\n|---|---|\n| Scope | face |\n| Written at | `node.data.semanticLevel, or node.data.view.semanticLevel` |\n| Type | enum |\n| Default | detail |\n| Valid | badge, icon, summary, detail (glyph and dot read as badge; card as summary) |\n| Applies | browse |\n| Properties panel | no |\n| Written down | no |\n| Status | built |"
        },
        "switch": {
          "name": "semanticLevel",
          "scope": "face",
          "writtenAt": "node.data.semanticLevel, or node.data.view.semanticLevel",
          "type": "enum",
          "default": "detail",
          "valid": "badge, icon, summary, detail (glyph and dot read as badge; card as summary)",
          "effect": "Names the representation a face is. The algorithm that picks one for a size reads these; it is a policy, below.",
          "appliesIn": "browse",
          "panel": "no",
          "writtenDown": "no",
          "status": "built"
        },
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "authoring-switches"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "authoring-switches-switch-handle-presentation",
      "type": "content",
      "label": "handlePresentation (and handleRef)",
      "position": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 3140
      },
      "width": 600,
      "height": 620,
      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": true,
      "data": {
        "content": {
          "kind": "markdown",
          "value": "## handlePresentation (and handleRef)\n\nThe art the port wears: a small graph whose view holds SVG, HTML or canvas, drawn whole with its centre on the border. Changes how the port looks, never how it behaves.\n\n| | |\n|---|---|\n| Scope | port or node |\n| Written at | `node.data.handlePresentation` |\n| Type | reference |\n| Default | none: the plain disc |\n| Valid | a string address, or { sourceRef, sourceNodeId, sourcePayload } |\n| Applies | edit, browse (live only while editing) |\n| Properties panel | no |\n| Written down | AGENTS.md |\n| Status | built |"
        },
        "switch": {
          "name": "handlePresentation (and handleRef)",
          "scope": "port or node",
          "writtenAt": "node.data.handlePresentation",
          "type": "reference",
          "default": "none: the plain disc",
          "valid": "a string address, or { sourceRef, sourceNodeId, sourcePayload }",
          "effect": "The art the port wears: a small graph whose view holds SVG, HTML or canvas, drawn whole with its centre on the border. Changes how the port looks, never how it behaves.",
          "appliesIn": "edit, browse (live only while editing)",
          "panel": "no",
          "writtenDown": "AGENTS.md",
          "status": "built"
        },
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "authoring-switches"
        }
      }
    },
    {
