      "data": {
        "content": {
          "kind": "markdown",
          "value": "## defaultHandle\n\nThe art every Port the graph exposes wears, on a tile and on the root's own handles. A Port's own handle wins.\n\n| | |\n|---|---|\n| Scope | root |\n| Written at | `root.data.defaultHandle` |\n| Type | reference |\n| Default | none |\n| Valid | same as handlePresentation |\n| Applies | edit, browse |\n| Properties panel | no |\n| Written down | AGENTS.md |\n| Status | built |"
        },
        "switch": {
